        "original_id": "6a8c64b4-af66-5e71-91d1-6a8538ff9ae6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Juan Carlos Onetti, Richard Llewellyn\n- Works: Nuit de chien, Para esta noche\n- Roles: Novelist, short story author\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Dafydd Vivian Llewellyn Lloyd was born on 8 December 1906 and was known by the pen name Richard Llewellyn.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges was born on July 1, 1909, in Montevideo.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges was an Uruguayan novelist and author of short stories.\n- Nuit de chien is based on the novel Para esta noche by Juan Carlos Onetti.\n- Richard Llewellyn was a British novelist.\n- Richard Llewellyn died on 30 November 1983.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges died on May 30, 1994, in Madrid.",
